      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2014 International Society of Travel Medicine.",
        "AbstractText": "The following case report details a case of chikungunya fever in a returning traveler from Haiti. The report highlights the clinical presentation and natural history of the disease, and emphasizes that chikungunya has become established in the western hemisphere, with a resultant need for heightened provider awareness."
